    "physical_description": "This seal impression has as its central motif a crowned mythical snake (naga) rising from a lotus support.  Such symbolism is associated with the ruling households of central Java, where the crowned naga forms a recurring motif in court regalia.  This seal was probably used on a documents or money box at one of the courts of central Java.",
